<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Reset Your Password</title>
    <style>
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        padding: 40px 20px;
      }
      .email-container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        padding: 40px 30px;
        text-align: center;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .lock-icon {
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;
        margin: 0 auto 20px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      }
      .lock-icon svg { width: 40px; height: 40px; fill: #ffffff; }
      .header h1 { color: #ffffff; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
      .content { padding: 50px 40px; }
      .message { font-size: 16px; color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 30px; }
      .info-box {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f7fafc 0%, #edf2f7 100%);
        border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }
      .info-box p { color: #4a5568; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 10px 0; line-height: 1.6; }
      .info-box strong { color: #2d3748; }
      .button-container { text-align: center; margin: 40px 0; }
      .reset-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 16px 48px;
        border-radius: 50px;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 600;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
      }
      .divider { text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; color: #a0aec0; font-size: 14px; position: relative; }
      .link-box {
        background: #f7fafc;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        word-break: break-all;
        font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #4a5568;
        border: 1px dashed #cbd5e0;
      }
      .warning {
        background: #fff5f5;
        border-left: 4px solid #fc8181;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 25px 0;
      }
      .footer { background: #2d3748; padding: 30px 40px; text-align: center; }
      .footer p { color: #a0aec0; font-size: 13px; margin: 0 0 10px 0; line-height: 1.6; }
      .footer a { color: #667eea; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-container">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="lock-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 17C10.89 17 10 16.1 10 15C10 13.89 10.89 13 12 13C13.11 13 14 13.89 14 15C14 16.1 13.11 17 12 17ZM18 8C19.1 8 20 8.9 20 10V20C20 21.1 19.1 22 18 22H6C4.9 22 4 21.1 4 20V10C4 8.9 4.9 8 6 8H7V6C7 3.24 9.24 1 12 1C14.76 1 17 3.24 17 6V8H18ZM12 3C10.34 3 9 4.34 9 6V8H15V6C15 4.34 13.66 3 12 3Z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h1>Password Reset Request</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p class="message">We received a request to reset the password for your account associated with <strong><%= email %></strong>.</p>

        <div class="info-box">
          <p><strong>🔒 Security First:</strong> Your password reset link is secure and can only be used once.</p>
          <p><strong>⏰ Time Sensitive:</strong> This link will expire in <strong><%= expiryTime || "15 minutes" %></strong>.</p>
          <p><strong>🌍 Request Details:</strong> IP Address: <%= ipAddress || "Unknown" %> | Time: <%= new Date().toLocaleString() %></p>
        </div>

        <div class="button-container">
          <a href="<%= resetLink %>" class="reset-button">Reset My Password</a>
        </div>

        <div class="divider">OR</div>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; text-align: center;">If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link:</p>
        <div class="link-box"><%= resetLink %></div>

        <div class="warning">
          <p><strong>Didn't request this?</strong> If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this email.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p><strong><%= companyName || "Sufian Health Care" %></strong></p>
        <p>Need help? Contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail || "support@sufianhealthcare.com" %>"><%= supportEmail || "support@sufianhealthcare.com" %></a></p>
        <p>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= companyName || "Sufian Health Care" %>. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
